body.en:
Fictional review note for Atlas API v2.3.1. Contract: a valid name returns HTTP 200. An absent field returns HTTP 400 with VAL-MISSING. An empty or whitespace-only field should return HTTP 400 with VAL-EMPTY. Current handler code:

```js
function handleName(req, res) {
  const name = req.body.name;
  if (name === undefined) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: "VAL-MISSING" });
  }
  const formatted = formatName(name);
  return res.status(200).json({ name: formatted });
}
```

The validator never checks empty or whitespace-only values. formatName assumes at least one character, so an empty or whitespace-only value raises an unhandled error. The proposed patch adds an empty and whitespace check before formatName and returns HTTP 400 with VAL-EMPTY. No other module is affected.

body.zh:
Atlas API v2.3.1 的虛構審查備註。合約：有效名稱回傳 HTTP 200。欄位缺失回傳 HTTP 400 及 VAL-MISSING。空值或只有空白應回傳 HTTP 400 及 VAL-EMPTY。現行處理器程式碼：

```js
function handleName(req, res) {
  const name = req.body.name;
  if (name === undefined) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: "VAL-MISSING" });
  }
  const formatted = formatName(name);
  return res.status(200).json({ name: formatted });
}
```

驗證器從不檢查空值或只有空白。formatName 假設至少有一個字元，因此空值或只有空白會引發未處理錯誤。建議修補在 formatName 之前加入空值及空白檢查，並回傳 HTTP 400 及 VAL-EMPTY。其他模組不受影響。

body.en:
Fictional code for review only, not executed here. Contract: resolveBanner(state) receives state as exactly one of "on", "off" or "unknown" and returns true to render the banner or false to skip it. The banner is non-critical and must never block checkout. Current code:
```ts
export function resolveBanner(state: "on" | "off" | "unknown"): boolean {
  if (state === "on") {
    return true
  }
  return true
}
```
Test log (synthetic, not run here): resolveBanner("on") returned true. resolveBanner("off") returned true. resolveBanner("unknown") returned true. The teammate intends unknown to skip the banner, so the unknown case is the defect. The off case is also a defect under the contract, because off must skip the banner.

body.zh:
僅供審查的虛構程式碼，此處不會執行。合約：resolveBanner(state) 接收的 state 必須是 "on"、"off" 或 "unknown" 其中之一，回傳 true 表示顯示橫幅，false 表示略過。橫幅並非關鍵功能，且不得阻擋結帳。現行程式碼：
```ts
export function resolveBanner(state: "on" | "off" | "unknown"): boolean {
  if (state === "on") {
    return true
  }
  return true
}
```
測試記錄（合成，此處未執行）：resolveBanner("on") 回傳 true。resolveBanner("off") 回傳 true。resolveBanner("unknown") 回傳 true。同事期望 unknown 略過橫幅，因此 unknown 個案即為缺陷。按合約，off 個案亦為缺陷，因為 off 必須略過橫幅。

body.en:
All records are fictional. The client sends one Idempotency-Key per physical request. Contract: a repeated key with an identical body must return HTTP 200 with the original order. A repeated key with a different body must return HTTP 409. A new key always creates a new order. Key scope options are per-request, per-cart or per-merchant. Contract version 1.4 is the only approved version.
```ts
// Fictional checkout client, contract v1.4
export async function submitCheckout(cartId: string, body: CheckoutBody) {
  const key = crypto.randomUUID() // new key on every call
  return fetch('/checkout', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
}
```
Input: cartId and body. Output: fetch response. Observed: each retry calls submitCheckout again and generates a fresh key.

body.zh:
所有記錄均為虛構。客戶端每個實際請求傳送一個 Idempotency-Key。合約：相同鍵配合相同內容必須回傳 HTTP 200 及原訂單。相同鍵配合不同內容必須回傳 HTTP 409。新鍵一律建立新訂單。鍵範圍選項為每請求、每購物車或每商戶。合約版本 1.4 是唯一核准版本。
```ts
// 虛構結帳客戶端，合約 v1.4
export async function submitCheckout(cartId: string, body: CheckoutBody) {
  const key = crypto.randomUUID() // 每次呼叫都產生新鍵
  return fetch('/checkout', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
}
```
輸入：cartId 及 body。輸出：fetch 回應。觀察：每次重試都再次呼叫 submitCheckout 並產生新鍵。

exemplar.en:
Evidence: source-code v1.4 shows submitCheckout generates a fresh Idempotency-Key on every call, so cart-8842 retries created order-501, order-502 and order-503. source-log confirms one shopper tap and two network retries. Decision: use a per-cart key, the narrowest scope that still blocks duplicate orders for one cart. A repeated key with an identical body must return HTTP 200 with the original order, while a different body returns HTTP 409. Patch: derive the key from cartId so retries reuse it.
```ts
export async function submitCheckout(cartId: string, body: CheckoutBody) {
  const key = `cart-${cartId}` // stable per cart
  return fetch('/checkout', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
}
```
Calculation: the warehouse reserved 6 units of item A but only 2 were paid, so 4 units are overstated. Risk: order-502 and order-503 remain unpaid yet hold stock. Next step: test a repeated identical request and a repeated different request, keeping contract version 1.4 and the request body unchanged.

exemplar.zh:
證據：source-code v1.4 顯示 submitCheckout 每次呼叫都產生新的 Idempotency-Key，因此 cart-8842 的重試產生了 order-501、order-502 及 order-503。source-log 確認購物者只點擊一次，網絡重試兩次。決策：採用每購物車鍵，這是仍能阻止同一購物車重複下單的最窄範圍。相同鍵配合相同內容必須回傳 HTTP 200 及原訂單，不同內容則回傳 HTTP 409。修正：由 cartId 推導鍵，使重試重用同一鍵。
```ts
export async function submitCheckout(cartId: string, body: CheckoutBody) {
  const key = `cart-${cartId}` // 每購物車固定
  return fetch('/checkout', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
}
```
計算：倉庫預留6件貨品A，但只有2件已付款，故虛增4件。風險：order-502 及 order-503 仍未付款卻佔用庫存。下一步：測試重複相同請求及重複不同請求，保留合約版本 1.4 及不更改請求內容。

body.en:
Simulated code and contract. Currency HKD. Rule: displayed price equals base price plus 5 percent tax, rounded down to the nearest whole HKD. The same rule applies to English and Traditional Chinese storefronts. The frontend calls GET /api/price?base=199&locale=zh-HK and expects {displayed: number}. The snippet below has one defect.

```ts
export function displayedPrice(base: number, locale: string): number {
  const taxRate = locale === 'en' ? 0.05 : 0;
  return Math.floor(base * (1 + taxRate));
}
```

Contract examples: base 199 gives displayed 208. Base 250 gives displayed 262. No other fees apply.

body.zh:
模擬程式碼及合約。貨幣為 HKD。規則：顯示價格等於基本價格加百分之五稅項，向下捨入至最接近的整數 HKD。同一規則適用於英文及繁體中文店面。前端呼叫 GET /api/price?base=199&locale=zh-HK，並預期 {displayed: number}。以下程式碼有一個缺陷。

```ts
export function displayedPrice(base: number, locale: string): number {
  const taxRate = locale === 'en' ? 0.05 : 0;
  return Math.floor(base * (1 + taxRate));
}
```

合約示例：基本價格 199 得出顯示價格 208。基本價格 250 得出顯示價格 262。沒有其他費用。

body.en:
Fictional change CR-204 adds pagination to a product list of 47 items. Page size is 10. Page numbering starts at 0. Contract: pageItems(page) returns items where index i satisfies i >= page * 10 AND i < (page + 1) * 10. Current code:
```ts
export function pageItems(items: string[], page: number): string[] {
  const size = 10
  return items.filter((_, i) => i > page * size && i <= (page + 1) * size)
}
```
Test log T-1: page 0 returns 10 items. Test log T-2: page 4 returns 6 items. No test covers page 3. The change is not yet released.

body.zh:
虛構改動 CR-204 為 47 個項目的產品清單加入分頁。每頁 10 項。頁碼由 0 開始。合約：pageItems(page) 回傳索引 i 滿足 i >= page * 10 且 i < (page + 1) * 10 的項目。現行程式碼：
```ts
export function pageItems(items: string[], page: number): string[] {
  const size = 10
  return items.filter((_, i) => i > page * size && i <= (page + 1) * size)
}
```
測試記錄 T-1：第 0 頁回傳 10 項。測試記錄 T-2：第 4 頁回傳 6 項。沒有測試覆蓋第 3 頁。此改動尚未發佈。

exemplar.en:
Fictional change CR-204 has an off-by-one boundary defect. The condition uses i > page * size && i <= (page + 1) * size, so the first item of the next page is included. Page 0 and page 4 logs match the current code, but no test covers page 3. I chose Option A at 5 hours because the team requires a code fix plus at least one boundary test, and 5 hours is within the 6 hour budget. Option B has no code fix, Option C has no test, and Option D has neither. Corrected code:
```ts
export function pageItems(items: string[], page: number): string[] {
  const size = 10
  return items.filter((_, i) => i >= page * size && i < (page + 1) * size)
}
```
Boundary tests must cover page 3, the last full page, and page 4, the first partial page. After the fix, page 3 returns 10 items. Risk: the current log has no page 3 evidence, so release should wait for the new test.

exemplar.zh:
虛構改動 CR-204 有差一錯誤的邊界缺陷。條件使用 i > page * size && i <= (page + 1) * size，因此下一頁首個項目被包含。第 0 頁及第 4 頁紀錄與現行程式碼一致，但沒有測試覆蓋第 3 頁。我選擇選項 A，5 小時，因團隊要求程式修正及至少一項邊界測試，而 5 小時在 6 小時預算內。選項 B 沒有程式修正，選項 C 沒有測試，選項 D 兩者皆無。修正後程式碼：
```ts
export function pageItems(items: string[], page: number): string[] {
  const size = 10
  return items.filter((_, i) => i >= page * size && i < (page + 1) * size)
}
```
邊界測試須覆蓋第 3 頁（最後一個完整頁）及第 4 頁（首個不完整頁）。修正後第 3 頁回傳 10 項。風險：現有紀錄沒有第 3 頁證據，發佈應等待新測試。

body.en:
Fictional client code and contract. The client sends one request per physical update and must reuse the same idempotency key when retrying that same physical request. A new physical request always gets a new key. The server accepts an update only when the caller account id equals the record owner account id. Editor without owner returns 409 and is held. No role returns 403. Accepted returns 200. Each request carries one caller account id, one target record id, one role and one idempotency key.
```ts
export async function updateProfile(recordId: string, body: Profile, key: string) {
  const res = await fetch(`/api/customers/${recordId}`, {
    method: "PUT",
    headers: { "content-type": "application/json", "idempotency-key": key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
  if (res.status === 200) return { ok: true }
  return { ok: false, status: res.status }
}
```
Defect: the caller retries a failed physical request with a freshly generated key, so a duplicate write can be accepted twice. Contract requires the same key on retry of the same physical request.

body.zh:
虛構客戶端程式碼及合約。客戶端每次實際更新只發一個請求，重試同一實際請求時必須重用同一冪等鍵。新的實際請求一律使用新鍵。只有當呼叫者帳戶編號等於記錄擁有者帳戶編號時，伺服器才接受更新。持有編輯者但非擁有者回傳 409 並保留待審。不持有任何角色回傳 403。接受回傳 200。每個請求帶一個呼叫者帳戶編號、一個目標記錄編號、一個角色及一個冪等鍵。
```ts
export async function updateProfile(recordId: string, body: Profile, key: string) {
  const res = await fetch(`/api/customers/${recordId}`, {
    method: "PUT",
    headers: { "content-type": "application/json", "idempotency-key": key },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  })
  if (res.status === 200) return { ok: true }
  return { ok: false, status: res.status }
}
```
缺陷：呼叫者重試失敗的實際請求時產生新鍵，令重複寫入可能被接受兩次。合約要求重試同一實際請求時使用同一鍵。

exemplar.en:
Evidence: CN-14 adds an INFO log line writing the full customer email. LR-3 says personal data must be masked before INFO logging, and masked values may be logged at INFO. The logCheckout code returns the raw email, and TL-9 shows alice@example.com and bob@example.com appearing unmasked, so two of three tests breach the rule. Decision and calculations: R-7 contains one change, CN-14. The fix is to mask the email before the INFO line, for example ***@example.com. A corrected version is:

```ts
export function logCheckout(email: string): string {
  const masked = email.replace(/^[^@]*/, "***")
  return `checkout email=${masked}`
}
```

Tests should confirm masked output, safe empty-email handling and no raw email in INFO. Risks: TL-9 Test C only covers the current unmasked empty-email path, so the corrected masking behaviour for empty email is untested, and other personal-data fields are untested. I would add a targeted test for empty email and a review of nearby log lines. Next steps: apply the masking fix, rerun the three tests, then request code review before release. No code was executed and all data is fictional.

exemplar.zh:
證據：CN-14 新增一行 INFO 記錄，寫入完整客戶電郵。LR-3 訂明個人資料須先遮蔽才可在 INFO 記錄，而已遮蔽的值可在 INFO 記錄。logCheckout 程式碼回傳原始電郵，TL-9 顯示 alice@example.com 及 bob@example.com 未遮蔽出現，故三項測試中兩項違反規則。決策與計算：R-7 只有一項改動，即 CN-14。修正為在 INFO 行前遮蔽電郵，例如 ***@example.com。修正版本如下：

```ts
export function logCheckout(email: string): string {
  const masked = email.replace(/^[^@]*/, "***")
  return `checkout email=${masked}`
}
```

測試應確認遮蔽輸出、空電郵安全處理，以及 INFO 不出現原始電郵。風險：TL-9 測試 C 只涵蓋現時未遮蔽的空電郵路徑，修正後空電郵的遮蔽行為未經測試，其他個人資料欄位亦未經測試。我會新增針對空電郵的測試並審查附近記錄行。下一步：套用遮蔽修正，重跑三項測試，然後在發布前請求程式碼審查。沒有執行程式碼，所有資料均為虛構。

body.en:
Fictional file api_client.ts. Contract: fetchPage(page, size) returns items for zero-based page index page, where page starts at 0. An item at index i is included when i >= page*size AND i < (page+1)*size. Each physical HTTP request must carry a unique idempotency key. On retry of the same physical request the client must reuse the same idempotency key. Retries are allowed only for 5xx responses and network timeouts. Maximum retries per request is 3. Maximum total wait per request is 8 seconds. Every retry change requires at least one automated test covering a 5xx success and one covering a 400 non-retry. This is a fictional learning assumption, not legal or technical advice.

```ts
export async function fetchPage(page: number, size: number) {
  const start = page * size
  const end = (page + 1) * size
  let attempt = 0
  while (attempt <= 3) {
    const res = await http.get('/items', {
      params: { start, end },
      headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': newKey() },
    })
    if (res.status >= 500 || res.status === 400 || res.status === 401) {
      attempt += 1
      continue
    }
    return res.data
  }
  throw new Error('request failed')
}
```

body.zh:
虛構檔案 api_client.ts。合約：fetchPage(page, size) 回傳零基頁索引 page 的項目，page 由 0 開始。索引為 i 的項目在 i >= page*size 且 i < (page+1)*size 時會被納入。每個實際 HTTP 請求必須帶有唯一的冪等鍵。重試同一實際請求時，客戶端必須重用同一冪等鍵。只允許對 5xx 回應及網絡逾時重試。每個請求最多重試 3 次。每個請求最長總等待時間為 8 秒。每次重試改動須至少有一個涵蓋 5xx 成功的自動測試，以及一個涵蓋 400 不重試的自動測試。此為虛構學習假設，並非法律或技術建議。

```ts
export async function fetchPage(page: number, size: number) {
  const start = page * size
  const end = (page + 1) * size
  let attempt = 0
  while (attempt <= 3) {
    const res = await http.get('/items', {
      params: { start, end },
      headers: { 'Idempotency-Key': newKey() },
    })
    if (res.status >= 500 || res.status === 400 || res.status === 401) {
      attempt += 1
      continue
    }
    return res.data
  }
  throw new Error('request failed')
}
```

body.en:
Simulated contract, version 2.4. Endpoint PATCH /baskets/{id} accepts quantity as an integer from 1 to 9 inclusive. Quantity 0 is rejected with code QTY_ZERO. Quantity above 9 is rejected with code QTY_MAX. A request missing the quantity field is rejected with code QTY_MISSING. A non-integer quantity such as 2.5 must be rejected with code QTY_NOT_INTEGER. Every accepted update must return HTTP 200 and the new quantity. Rejected updates must return HTTP 422 and must not change stored quantity. Every request must send Content-Type application/json and an Idempotency-Key header. One logical merchant action supplies one stable idempotency key. A network retry of that same logical action must reuse the same key. A new logical action must use a new key. The contract states no partial acceptance. Readable fictional server handler:
```ts
export function validateQuantity(input: { quantity?: number }) {
  if (input.quantity === undefined) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MISSING" }
  }
  if (input.quantity < 1) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_ZERO" }
  }
  if (input.quantity > 9) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MAX" }
  }
  return { status: 200, code: "OK" }
}
```
Defect: quantity 2.5 passes all guards and returns OK, but the contract requires an integer. Also, a negative quantity such as -1 returns QTY_ZERO, which the contract does not define. Readable fictional client snippet:
```ts
async function submitQuantity(basketId: string, quantity: number) {
  const res = await fetch(`/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: "PATCH",
    body: JSON.stringify({ quantity }),
  })
  if (!res.ok) {
    showMessage("Update failed")
    return
  }
  showMessage("Saved")
}
```
Defect: the client omits the Content-Type and Idempotency-Key headers, shows a generic message and discards the server rejection code, so the merchant cannot see which rule was broken.

body.zh:
模擬合約，版本 2.4。端點 PATCH /baskets/{id} 接受數量為 1 至 9 的整數（含首尾）。數量 0 會以代碼 QTY_ZERO 拒絕。數量大於 9 會以代碼 QTY_MAX 拒絕。缺少數量欄位的請求會以代碼 QTY_MISSING 拒絕。非整數數量如 2.5 必須以代碼 QTY_NOT_INTEGER 拒絕。每個獲接受的更新必須回傳 HTTP 200 及新數量。被拒絕的更新必須回傳 HTTP 422，且不得改變已儲存數量。每個請求必須傳送 Content-Type application/json 及 Idempotency-Key 標頭。一個邏輯商戶動作提供一個穩定冪等鍵。同一邏輯動作的網絡重試必須重用同一鍵。新的邏輯動作必須使用新鍵。合約沒有部分接受。可讀虛構後端處理程式：
```ts
export function validateQuantity(input: { quantity?: number }) {
  if (input.quantity === undefined) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MISSING" }
  }
  if (input.quantity < 1) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_ZERO" }
  }
  if (input.quantity > 9) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MAX" }
  }
  return { status: 200, code: "OK" }
}
```
缺陷：數量 2.5 通過所有防護並回傳 OK，但合約要求整數。此外，負數如 -1 回傳 QTY_ZERO，而合約並無定義此情況。可讀虛構前端片段：
```ts
async function submitQuantity(basketId: string, quantity: number) {
  const res = await fetch(`/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: "PATCH",
    body: JSON.stringify({ quantity }),
  })
  if (!res.ok) {
    showMessage("Update failed")
    return
  }
  showMessage("Saved")
}
```
缺陷：前端缺少 Content-Type 及 Idempotency-Key 標頭，顯示通用訊息並丟棄伺服器拒絕代碼，商戶無法看到違反了哪條規則。

exemplar.en:
Corrected server patch:
```ts
export function validateQuantity(input: { quantity?: number }) {
  if (input.quantity === undefined) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MISSING" }
  }
  if (!Number.isInteger(input.quantity)) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_NOT_INTEGER" }
  }
  if (input.quantity === 0) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_ZERO" }
  }
  if (input.quantity < 0) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_NEGATIVE" }
  }
  if (input.quantity > 9) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MAX" }
  }
  return { status: 200, code: "OK" }
}
```
Corrected client patch:
```ts
async function submitQuantity(basketId: string, quantity: number, idempotencyKey: string) {
  const res = await fetch(`/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: "PATCH",
    headers: {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "Idempotency-Key": idempotencyKey,
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ quantity }),
  })
  const body = await res.json()
  if (!res.ok) {
    showMessage(`Update failed: ${body.code}`)
    return
  }
  showMessage("Saved")
}
```
Why it fixes the defect: The original guards let 2.5 through as OK. The Number.isInteger check now rejects it with QTY_NOT_INTEGER. The client now sends Content-Type and Idempotency-Key, keeps the same key when a network retry repeats the same logical action, and reads the response body to show the rejection code beside the basket line, matching F-77.
Proposed test cases and expected outcomes: 2.5 gives 422 QTY_NOT_INTEGER. -1 gives 422 QTY_NEGATIVE. 0 gives 422 QTY_ZERO. 1 gives 200 OK. 9 gives 200 OK. 10 gives 422 QTY_MAX. A network retry of one logical action reuses the same Idempotency-Key.
Evidence: R1 quantity 4 returned 200 and stored 4, so it is accepted. R2 quantity 12 returned 422 QTY_MAX and stored stayed 3. R3 quantity 0 returned 422 QTY_ZERO and stored stayed 5. Both rejections are compliant. One accepted and two rejected updates appear.
Limitations: Only three records exist, no network retry was attempted, and the contract does not define a code for negative quantities, so QTY_NEGATIVE is a documented proposal. F-77 states no budget or deadline.

exemplar.zh:
修正後端：
```ts
export function validateQuantity(input: { quantity?: number }) {
  if (input.quantity === undefined) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MISSING" }
  }
  if (!Number.isInteger(input.quantity)) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_NOT_INTEGER" }
  }
  if (input.quantity === 0) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_ZERO" }
  }
  if (input.quantity < 0) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_NEGATIVE" }
  }
  if (input.quantity > 9) {
    return { status: 422, code: "QTY_MAX" }
  }
  return { status: 200, code: "OK" }
}
```
修正前端：
```ts
async function submitQuantity(basketId: string, quantity: number, idempotencyKey: string) {
  const res = await fetch(`/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: "PATCH",
    headers: {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "Idempotency-Key": idempotencyKey,
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ quantity }),
  })
  const body = await res.json()
  if (!res.ok) {
    showMessage(`Update failed: ${body.code}`)
    return
  }
  showMessage("Saved")
}
```
為何能修正問題：原本的防護讓 2.5 以 OK 通過。Number.isInteger 檢查現以 QTY_NOT_INTEGER 拒絕。前端現傳送 Content-Type 及 Idempotency-Key，當網絡重試重複同一邏輯動作時保留同一鍵，並讀取回應內文在購物籃行旁顯示拒絕代碼，符合 F-77。
建議測試個案及預期結果：2.5 得 422 QTY_NOT_INTEGER。-1 得 422 QTY_NEGATIVE。0 得 422 QTY_ZERO。1 得 200 OK。9 得 200 OK。10 得 422 QTY_MAX。同一邏輯動作的網絡重試重用同一 Idempotency-Key。
證據：R1 數量 4 回傳 200 並儲存 4，屬獲接受。R2 數量 12 回傳 422 QTY_MAX，已儲存維持 3。R3 數量 0 回傳 422 QTY_ZERO，已儲存維持 5。兩者均符合合約。記錄中有一個獲接受及兩個被拒絕更新。
限制：只有三筆記錄、並無嘗試網絡重試，而合約沒有為負數數量定義代碼，故 QTY_NEGATIVE 屬已記錄的建議。F-77 沒有列明預算或期限。

